TI  - Designs & Discussions: An RPG About the Indie Scene
AU  - White, William J.
T2  - Tabletop RPG Design in Theory and Practice at the Forge, 2001–2012: Designs and Discussions
A2  - White, William J.
T3  - Palgrave Games in Context
AB  - This chapter presents a short tabletop role-playing game that has been designed to highlight the nature of the Forge as a kind of participatory culture. Characters are role-players who want to take TRPG play, design, and publication seriously, who post about role-playing online, and who create games and other projects that demonstrate their views. Completing such projects increases their ‘indie cred,’ and both posting and working on projects provide experience that may develop their skills. It uses examples from a recorded playtest session of the game being played to illustrate the rules.
