TY  - CHAP
TI  - The Seasons of the Forge: A Structural History, 2001–2012
AU  - White, William J.
T2  - Tabletop RPG Design in Theory and Practice at the Forge, 2001–2012: Designs and Discussions
A2  - White, William J.
T3  - Palgrave Games in Context
AB  - This chapter outlines the history of the Forge from its first appearance through its growth and development over the course of more than a decade before being closed to new posts by its owners. It discusses the nature of participation at the Forge, and describes the culture of the Forge as well as the response to the Forge by outside observers within the broader TRPG culture. It pays some attention to the experiences of marginalization and exclusion reported by some people. It describes the structural changes implemented by the Forge’s administrators to shape the discourse of the Forge, and briefly discusses the larger ‘Forge Diaspora’ initiated to supplement the Forge as a community. It concludes with a rhetorical appraisal of an online conversation about what happened to the Forge.
CY  - Cham
