TI  - Augmented Tabletop Games Workshop
AU  - Toups, Zachary O.
AU  - LaLone, Nicolas
AU  - Buruk, Oğuz Turan
AU  - Tanenbaum, Joshua
AU  - Trammell, Aaron
AU  - Hammer, Jessica
AU  - Depping, Ansgar
T3  - CHI PLAY '17 Extended Abstracts
AB  - This workshop gathers researchers and practitioners interested in augmented tabletop games: physical games that include digital augmentation. Participants will compile ways of knowing for this unique research space and share their methods of research, demonstrating, where possible, through a research gaming and prototyping session. Post-workshop, we will assemble an online compendium for findings, which will include video sketches recorded during the workshop and an annotated bibliography.
