TY  - THES
TI  - Med ett tärningskast : En analys av slumpens påverkan på narrativet i Dungeons & Dragons
AU  - Emmy, Gagner-Geeber
AB  - This paper delves into the world of Dungeons & Dragons and discusses the creation of narrative within an interactive media with focus on the aspects of the game that aren’t controlled by the player or the dungeon master. Its focal point is the random elements of the game that appear through the roll of dice, with an added bonus of the Tarokka cards from Wizards of the Coast’s Curse of Strahd. All with the aim to get a better understanding of how narrative is created within the game, and how the random structures within it affects its storytelling. I do this by applying Mieke Bal’s theory of narratology to my reading of Curse of Strahd, and the creation and playing of my own one-shot Venlas öde.
