TI  - Análisis del orientalismo en el continente ficticio Kara-Tur de Dungeons & Dragons
AU  - Gutiérrez Ferrer, Noemí
AB  - In this work, we will analyze the orientalist discourse presented in the fictional continent Kara-Tur, belonging to the Dungeons & Dragons role-playing game. Thus, we will begin with a brief history of role-playing games, and, afterward, we will go on to the analysis, where we will see the underlying orientalist topics in the text of the manuals and their introduction within the gameplay itself. Finally, we will establish a comparison with later products based in East Asia to analyze whether they respect reality or whether they continue to use it to add mystery and exoticism to fiction, falling into orientalism.
