TI  - SpellForge : a creative design tabletop role playing game
AU  - VanDerZwan, Nicolaas
AB  - The design of a novel Tabletop Role Playing Game was conducted with the aim to create a game system that provides both rigid rules and more creative outlets compared to existing games. The project focused on player-developed mystical abilities known as Spells, whereby the rule of the game guides the player in making any effect they can imagine. The project also includes unique decisions that players can make regarding class and species-related abilities. The project underwent myriad iterations of design, testing, and revision. The application of this process produced a well-developed final ruleset that multiple groups of play testers expressed as being akin to a published game.
