AB  - The Wrath of Noesangkara is an Indonesian-themed fantasy tabletop roleplaying game that teaches students about Indonesian culture while also providing a new way to play teamwork without worrying about toxic traits. The game is designed to allow players to achieve the main goal by cooperating while exploring and learning about traditional weapons and spells, as well as fighting creatures from Indonesian legends and myths. Boardgames have a long history of bringing up moral ideas from the past, and they have evolved into a medium for learning through play. It is an excellent platform for engaging and enjoyable learning of Indonesian culture.
