TY  - THES
TI  - The Creation and Visual Design of the Characters for a Role-Playing Tabletop Game
AU  - Espés Rodríguez, Edurne
AB  - Medieval fantasy has always been a source of scapism, inspiration an awe. In an age where role-playing games are more famous than ever, the opportunity to become one of the heroes of a fantastical tale is at the reach of your palm. Deciding on one concept, when the array of possibilities is endless, is a struggle. Then, understanding how to embody another persona is an even greater challenge. This project is centered in the process of character creation for a role-playing game set represeting the traditional character archetypes in a medieval fantasy world. It encompasses all the stages from character conceptualization to the final individual design, emphasizing the impact that equipment and attire have on how a character presents themselves to the world.
