TI  - Statistics with Actuarial Emphasis
AU  - Yonker, Zachariah
AB  - This report presents the findings of a survey conducted among members of the Grand Valley State University Dungeons & Dragons Club, focusing on member age, gender, habits, and game preferences. The survey, administered during the Fall 2024 semester, received 31 responses, with 30 being completed and 1 partially finished, representing approximately 25% of active club members. Key findings via the Statistical Analysis System (SAS) include a diverse range of preferences and opinions about Dungeons & Dragons classes, as well as a consensus on the most difficult challenge of the activity in addition to favorite aspects of Dungeons & Dragons.
