TI  - In Miniature: A Study of Craft and Play in the Wargaming Industry
AU  - Williams, Ian G.
AB  - This dissertation employs qualitative and theoretical methods to analyze the relationship between craft and industry in the miniatures wargames industry in and around Nottingham, UK. It asks fundamental questions about how craft is defined and how craft communities operate. This project particularly attends to questions of communication and meaning-making at miniatures studios, attending to questions of practice, subcultural currency, masculinity, and negotiations between practitioners and British history. Lastly, it attends to matters of technological change within the miniatures wargames industry as new digital technologies and analog practices expand definitions of and accessibility to craft.
