TI  - On Collaboration, Relationality, and Failure: Dispatches from a Dungeon Master after theAcademy
AU  - Ancharski, Kelly
T2  - The Review of Higher Education
AB  - Over airwaves and scribbled notes, I ponder what worlds of higher education learning look/feel/sound like that not only critique the regime of knowledge production but create elsewheres. I do so through play as attitude, kin, and becoming. Through storytelling as a gamer and scholar, I recount dispatches of collaboration, relationality, and failure. They illuminate the vast capacity-building and worldmaking of play, as well as how we can resist the colonization of our imagination (what is/was/could be). I invite you to play, break the rules-as-written, and homebrew more fates and worlds of higher education.
